{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03N9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\nH_\\etale^i (X, \\mathbf{Q}_\\ell) :=\n\\left( \\lim_n H_\\etale^i(X, \\mathbf{Z}/\\ell^n\\mathbf{Z}) \\right)\n\\otimes_{\\mathbf{Z}_\\ell} \\mathbf{Q}_\\ell.\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$\\lim_n$", "MATH_0003": "$H_\\etale^i(X, \\mathbf{Z}/\\ell^n\\mathbf{Z})$", "MATH_0004": "$n$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-section-posets-limits}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f60f81b83493f6e0c3ccecd7b66baf31480f8d57c581eb98bc8b8ede4bf16fe1", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0c8df3d5659d7b05e808f5ace90fd8885892b321b8f33639f68ea350e4f01bdb", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nTo study nontorsion coefficients, one makes the following definition:\n<MATH_0001>\nThe symbol <MATH_0002> denote the <TEXTITOPEN_0001>limit<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> of the system of\ncohomology groups <MATH_0003> indexed\nby <MATH_0004>, see\nCategories, Section <REF_0001>.\nThus we will need to study systems of sheaves satisfying some compatibility\nconditions.\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d67811bc93f39ae2be741c5e18f67364e5f389e896f40604a8a31bb45fc91a6a", "unit_id": "tag:03N9:prose-0001"}
